{"steam_appid":3948100,"steam_name":"Towerfolk","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3948100/555004766/9936160e6af3ee2c7e6716674f044a8c93249cd0/1768485884/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768486480","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257265312/b33a8e5e9c2699a175e84caa596d09630c2ed227/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1768486480","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948100/6202d1b198310dcbbbdf8696bd102b0c53737709/ss_6202d1b198310dcbbbdf8696bd102b0c53737709.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791561384","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948100/a89162b8e028dabf88d410f5caf4ba10d7c457c4/ss_a89162b8e028dabf88d410f5caf4ba10d7c457c4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791561384","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948100/6cd4ff38517ebe7ca241586069deeeb77c25d3a6/ss_6cd4ff38517ebe7ca241586069deeeb77c25d3a6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791561384","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948100/eada86eeb9058b442993ab4d9226aedd13838751/ss_eada86eeb9058b442993ab4d9226aedd13838751.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791561384","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948100/4d48c42f0cde57d3aad6c72daa4dd3bcaddb1cb1/ss_4d48c42f0cde57d3aad6c72daa4dd3bcaddb1cb1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791561384"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend the City Against Bandits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train soldiers to guard your city, construct defensive towers, and strengthen your walls against constant threats. Prepare your forces and stay alert bandit raids can happen at any time. Only a well-defended city will survive and prosper.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948100/extras/6b0832b083845558a5677632d04d8cdb.poster.avif?t=1791561384\" width=1000 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948100/extras/6b0832b083845558a5677632d04d8cdb.webm?t=1791561384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948100/extras/6b0832b083845558a5677632d04d8cdb.mp4?t=1791561384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Build Your City Freely</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your lands and shape your city the way you imagine. Gather resources like stone, wood, and iron, establish production sites, and strengthen your economy. Outbuild your rivals, gain the upper hand, and transform your city into a thriving trade hub.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948100/extras/86922c65a82aaabe4179fa34b604932e.poster.avif?t=1791561384\" width=1000 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948100/extras/86922c65a82aaabe4179fa34b604932e.webm?t=1791561384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948100/extras/86922c65a82aaabe4179fa34b604932e.mp4?t=1791561384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Governance and People’s Happiness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building a city is not just about raising structures it’s about caring for your people. Provide food, housing, health, and security, while fulfilling royal demands to maintain order. A happy and healthy population is the true foundation of prosperity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948100/extras/05af31b733011fb1992b28fca606b1b8.poster.avif?t=1791561384\" width=1000 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948100/extras/05af31b733011fb1992b28fca606b1b8.webm?t=1791561384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Order and Economy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your threats aren’t only from outside danger lurks within as well. Keep thieves in check, prevent quarrels among soldiers, and protect your people from hunger. Balance food, shelter, and economy to maintain order and earn the trust of your citizens.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948100/extras/56dffe2ea7ac6f955579537caef3582c.poster.avif?t=1791561384\" width=1000 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948100/extras/56dffe2ea7ac6f955579537caef3582c.webm?t=1791561384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10,11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-9100 / i3-10100 or AMD Ryzen 3 3100 / Ryzen 3 3200G<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti or GTX 1650<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10,11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9400F or AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 or AMD Radeon RX 6600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Indie","Simulation","Strategy"],"developers":["99 Interactive"],"publishers":["99 Interactive"],"release_date":"Oct 9, 2026"}